--TEST--
the name after `is` is the interface, so renaming there renames the interface at its declaration, its `implements` clause and the test, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
interface Shape
{
    public function area(): int;
}

class Square implements Shape
{
    public function area(): int { return 4; }
}

mixed $s = new Square();
if ($s is Sh<|>ape) {
    echo $s->area();
}
--REQUEST--
rename to=Figure
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:2:11 Figure
case.nvs:7:25 Figure
case.nvs:13:11 Figure
